{"nodes": [{"id": "mockup_mockup_paleta", "label": "Paleta y variables del mockup (azul marino + \u00e1mbar)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Direcci\u00f3n de dise\u00f1o aprobada: fondo azul marino oscuro, acento \u00e1mbar/arcilla, sage para estados positivos, Fraunces para display y Karla para body. #2a1610 como tinta sobre rellenos s\u00f3lidos."}, {"id": "mockup_mockup_ember", "label": "Brasa que respira (.ember + @keyframes breathe)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Motivo de marca: gradiente radial \u00e1mbar con glow que late cada 3.2s. Se reusa como avatar en el header y como ilustraci\u00f3n del placeholder de Objetivos."}, {"id": "mockup_mockup_fab", "label": "FAB de voz del mockup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mismo gradiente que la brasa pero SIN la animaci\u00f3n de latido, y posicionado fuera de los .screen para quedar visible en cualquier pesta\u00f1a."}, {"id": "mockup_mockup_tabbar", "label": "Tab bar de 4 pesta\u00f1as del mockup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hablar/Memoria/Objetivos/Ajustes con \u00edconos de l\u00ednea y el activo en amber-soft; flex-shrink:0 para quedar fija bajo el \u00e1rea scrolleable."}, {"id": "mockup_mockup_screen_chat", "label": "Pantalla de chat del mockup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Burbujas asim\u00e9tricas (\u00c1mbar en surface-raised, usuario en clay) con la etiqueta 'Record\u00e9 esto' que muestra la memoria en acci\u00f3n, y un composer en p\u00edldora anclado abajo."}, {"id": "mockup_mockup_screen_memoria", "label": "Pantalla de memoria del mockup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tarjeta por hecho con chip de categor\u00eda en sage y basurero directo, sin di\u00e1logo de confirmaci\u00f3n. El copy 'Pod\u00e9s corregir o borrar cualquier dato' promete la edici\u00f3n que MemoriaScreen implement\u00f3 despu\u00e9s."}, {"id": "mockup_mockup_screen_objetivos", "label": "Placeholder de Objetivos del mockup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Anuncia expl\u00edcitamente que la secci\u00f3n llega en Fase 5, con la brasa ampliada como ilustraci\u00f3n."}, {"id": "mockup_mockup_screen_ajustes", "label": "Pantalla de ajustes del mockup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tarjetas con las dos keys BYOK (Gemini enmascarada con 'Quitar', Tavily vac\u00eda con 'Guardar') y toggles de preferencias que todav\u00eda no existen en el backend."}, {"id": "mockup_mockup_showscreen", "label": "showScreen() del mockup", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Navegaci\u00f3n por toggle de clase .active sobre los .screen \u2014 el equivalente de prototipo del router real y sus rutas anidadas."}, {"id": "mockup_mockup_pulsefab", "label": "pulseFab() del mockup", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Feedback t\u00e1ctil simulado con un scale temporal, \u00fanico comportamiento del FAB en el mockup: no abre nada."}], "edges": [{"source": "plan_ambar_chatscreen", "target": "mockup_mockup_screen_chat", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plan_ambar_settingsscreen", "target": "mockup_mockup_screen_ajustes", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mockup_mockup_screen_ajustes", "target": "plan_ambar_byok", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mockup_mockup_screen_memoria", "target": "plan_ambar_memoria_hechos", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mockup_mockup_screen_chat", "target": "plan_ambar_buscar_en_internet", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mockup_mockup_screen_chat", "target": "plan_ambar_recordar_hecho", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mockup_mockup_fab", "target": "mockup_mockup_ember", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "mockup/mockup.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mockup_mockup_ember", "target": "mockup_mockup_paleta", "relation": "references", "con